# Mechanic: Create an emblem, remove its creator, and resolve a later targeted emblem trigger.
# Forcing: Four creature deaths transform Sephiroth. Only the emblem can drain after Sephiroth dies.
# AI behavior: No hand or available mana. All actions occur during the human main phase.
# Failure modes: Win proves the final drain. Missing transform or targeting prevents lethal. A stalled prompt times out.
# Card roles: Four Rats supply the threshold. Courser survives the first damage. Murder removes the creator. Shock kills Courser.
# Protocol path: Command emblem, targeted Ability object, resolution, and transient ability retirement.
